abstract: "SuperCompress is a query-aware context compression engine for LLMs. Hosted Neural Keep is a ~400M-parameter cross-encoder; the OSS tree also ships a local compiler path. Evaluation emphasizes evidence containment. Do not cite private checkpoint filesystem paths."
